bsCoeffs -- a list of the Boij-Soederberg coefficients of a Veronese embedding
******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        bsCoeffs(d,n,b)
  * Inputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * b, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

This function returns a list of the Boij-Soederberg coefficients for the
decomposition of the Betti table of $\mathcal{O}(b)$ on $\mathbb{P}^{n}$ under
the $d$-fold Veronese embedding. See Section 6.3 of [BEGY].  Of course, these
coefficients and the corresponding pure diagrams are easily computed by
applying *note decompose(BettiTally):
(BoijSoederberg)decompose_lpBettiTally_rp, from the BoijSoederberg package to
the corresponding totalBettiTally.



