|                                     |
|            0  1   2   3   4   5  6 7|
|o1 = total: 1 27 105 189 189 105 27 1|
|         0: 1  .   .   .   .   .  . .|
|         1: . 27 105 189 189 105 27 .|
|         2: .  .   .   .   .   .  . 1|
|                                     |
|o1 : BettiTally                      |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = dominantWeightsBetti(3,2,0);|
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : D#(1,1)                         |
|                                     |
|o3 = {{4, 2, 0}}                     |
|                                     |
|o3 : List                            |
+-------------------------------------+
|i4 : D#(5,1)                         |
|                                     |
